    "enUS": {
      "description": "<The text on this note is made up of various typefaces glued onto the parchment's surface.>\n\nWe've got your precious book, gnome. If you ever want to see it again, you'll do exactly as we ask.\n\n<A detailed set of instructions is listed, spanning 3 pages.>\n\nBring the money and come alone!",
      "dialogue": {
        "33b316cd12158151218b": "<Narain's face glows a bright red.>$B$BBooknap my... book, will they!? I'll teach them what it means to mess with a psychic gnome!",
        "c365655ff4be9ac6a520": "Say, what's the matter?"
      },
      "summary": "Return the Ransom Letter to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.\n",
      "title": "rAnS0m",
